   "title": "Adjustment of Solid Minting Rate",
   "description": "The proposed adjustment entails updating the increase factor from 2 to 1. This modification aims to enhance the stability of Solid’s value. Consequently, the Mint Fee will be calculated utilizing the formula 1 - Price of Solid.\n\nThe primary rationale behind this proposal is to ensure the reliability and stability of Solid as a form of value for its users. By augmenting the minting fee function, the intention is to discourage the continuous minting of Solid when its value is below the peg.\n\nIt’s imperative to highlight that this update will not impact existing positions",
